I removed the `http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the linker rejects anything beyond that grant, so the fetch can't be linked until the `with` clause itself is extended to include `http-client`. The output is unchanged either way.

